<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN SCORE 186 FOR NINE V HUNTER INVITATION XI.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN SCORE 186 FOR NINE V HUNTER INVITATION XI.</headline>
<dateline>NEWCASTLE, Australia 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan scored 186 for nine in 32 overs against Hunter Invitation XI on Monday in a limited overs tour match reduced to 32 overs a side because of rain.</p>
<p>Score - Pakistan 186 for nine in 32 overs (Zahoor Elahi 69) v Hunter Invitation XI.</p>
